            <title>GhostCue 1.8.7</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 04:49:42 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.8.7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.8.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Buttery-smooth autoscroll</li>
                    <li>Cue Mode is now the main presentation button</li>
                    <li>Fixed clicking a note in the sidebar sometimes showing the wrong note or an empty editor until you clicked away.</li>
                    <li>Autoscroll speed is now one setting shared by every mode, and it's remembered — change it anywhere and it applies everywhere.</li>
                    <li>Wider cue card margins, so more text fits per line.</li>                </ul>
            ]]></description>
